            "sid": "JER 52:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Medo kwoŋ meno, Nebuzaradan, jamituka, okadho kodi Seraya jacway ri Were madwoŋ, Zefania m'oyido luwo Seraya i dwoŋ, kodi jotel man madongo adek ma Ot pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i tindi madwoŋ Nebuzaradan okadho kodi jatel m'oyido obedo jamituka pa jolweny, jomic rieko pa kere abirio m'oyido fodi jonitie i tindi madwoŋ, ŋata luwo kor jamituka, m'oyido obedo jandiko, kodi cwo 60 man madongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebuzaradan otero jo ri kere ma Babilon, m'oyido nitie i tindi madwoŋ ma Ribila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere ma Babilon orwadho jo piny, to neko jo i Ribila i piny ma Hamath. Ameno to Yuda kadho i wiloka woko ma piny pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a welo pa ji ma Nebukadineza otero paka jotwec i wiloka: I oro mar'abirio, Joyuda 3,023 ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i oro mar'apar g'aboro ma dhum pa Nebukadineza go otero i wiloka wok Yerusalem ji 832 ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i oro ma 23 ma dhum pa Nebukadineza, Nebuzaradan jamituka otero i wiloka ma Yuda ji 745. Ji je m'okadhi gi jo obedo 4,600.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inyutho Yehoyakin wor i katwec",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro ma 37 ma bedo i wiloka pa Kere Yehoyakin ma Yuda, i dwe mar'apar g'ario ka ndelo piero ario g'abic Kere Evilmerodak ma Babilon, i oro ma go ocak'iye dhum, go onyutho wor ri kere Yehoyakin ma Yuda to wodho go woko ma katwec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evilmerodak oluwo gine gi wor, to miyo go kabedo ma malo loyo kerin man je m'oyido go nitie gine i Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno to Yehoyakin ketho gicen nangin pere ma katwec, aka kisi ndelo ma kwo pere noknok go ocemo i meza pa kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Evilmerodak ma Babilon omiyo go pesa ma kwo kisi ndelo, tekin go oyido fodi kwo, tundo i ndelo ma tho pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
